<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications rose 5.8 percent in the week ended September 20, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages increased 5.0 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages rose 6.0 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index rose 5.0 percent to 263.3 from 250.8 the previous week, it said.</p>
<p>The purchase index rose 6.9 percent to 192.4 in the latest survey from 179.9 in the previous week, it said.  </p>
